### Implementation

#### 1. Entity Prototype (if not already defined)
In `Resources/Prototypes/_NF/Entities/Objects/Decoration/art.yml` (or `paintings.yml`):

```yaml
- type: entity
  name: large painting frame
  id: PaintingFrameLarge
  parent: PaintingFrame
  description: A large wooden frame for displaying paintings.
  components:
  - type: Sprite
    state: frame_large
  - type: PaintingFrame
    size: Large
```

---

#### 2. Crafting Recipes (Construction Graph & Construction Prototype)
In `Resources/Prototypes/_NF/Recipes/Construction/Graphs/items/painting_frame.yml`:

```yaml
- type: constructionGraph
  id: PaintingFrameLarge
  start: start
  graph:
    - node: start
      edges:
        - to: frame
          steps:
            - material: Wood
              amount: 4
              doAfter: 2
    - node: frame
      entity: PaintingFrameLarge
```

In `Resources/Prototypes/_NF/Recipes/Construction/furniture.yml` (or `items.yml`):

```yaml
- type: construction
  id: PaintingFrameLarge
  name: large painting frame
  category: construction-category-furniture
  graph: PaintingFrameLarge
  startNode: start
  targetNode: frame
  description: A large wooden frame for displaying paintings.
  icon:
    sprite: _NF/Objects/Decoration/art.rsi
    state: frame_large
  objectType: Item
```

---

#### 3. Buying (Market & Cargo Orders)
In `Resources/Prototypes/_NF/Catalog/Cargo/fun.yml` (or `market.yml`):

```yaml
- type: cargoProduct
  id: PaintingFrameLarge
  icon:
    sprite: _NF/Objects/Decoration/art.rsi
    state: frame_large
  product: PaintingFrameLarge
  cost: 250
  category: cargo-product-category-fun
  group: market

- type: cargoProduct
  id: CargoPaintingFrameLarge
  icon:
    sprite: _NF/Objects/Decoration/art.rsi
    state: frame_large
  product: PaintingFrameLarge
  cost: 250
  category: cargo-product-category-fun
  group: cargo
```

In `Resources/Prototypes/_NF/Entities/Containers/Crates/fun.yml` (add to `CrateArtSupplies` storage fill if present):

```yaml
      - id: PaintingFrameLarge
        amount: 2
```

In `Resources/Prototypes/_NF/VendingMachines/Inventories/art.yml` (if art vendor inventory exists):

```yaml
    PaintingFrameLarge: 5
```